      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Ain't no way we're gonna let 'em spoil the place,\" he might mutter, leaning in conspiratorially. She could sharply retort, \"Those folks bring trouble, Hank; we used to have regulars you could trust, not these... outsiders slumming down here.\" Their conversation should quickly devolve into explicit worry about specific groups encroaching on their \"proper\" customer base. This direct confrontation will give the raw, uncomfortable tension your prestige drama requires.",
      "source": "target",
